# C build verify (elomaxz)

Sessions show Read → StrReplace → Shell around LLVM-style C and docs cleanup.

After editing `.c`/`.h` or build files:

1. Run the project build command before done.
2. For `.clang-format` / ColumnLimit changes, read affected functions before reformatting.
3. Doc-only moves (md → images/, README logo): still verify links and paths after Shell listing.

Commit requests: stage only intended files; do not bundle unrelated clutter moves.
